  "notes": "pixiv's official VRoid Studio sample model AvatarSample_A (exported by VRoidStudio-0.14.0, UniGLTF-1.28), used as the open-annie hero 'Annie'. NOT CC0: redistribution/modification/commercial use are permitted by pixiv's sample-model conditions of use and the VRoid Hub license shown above; do not relabel as CC0. Bytes are the VRoid Studio-bundled export as mirrored in madjin/vrm-samples (the VRoid Hub download requires login); its embedded meta says licenseName 'Other' with empty otherPermissionUrl, while the Hub copy embeds the Hub license URL above. VRM 0.x: three-vrm maps A/I/U/E/O -> aa/ih/ou/ee/oh, Joy->happy, Sorrow->sad, Fun->relaxed. There is no VRM0 'surprised' preset: surprise is the custom expression 'Surprised' (bound to Face.baked morph 5). 'Extra' is a custom VRoid face (morphs 25+55). All expression binds target mesh 'Face.baked' (56 morph targets)."
